"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Root-caused the xdist classify collection collision: the engine ships rebar_reconciler/classify.py as a MODULE while tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/classify/ is a PACKAGE of the same dotted name. The conftest shadow bridge APPENDED the shadow dir after the engine dir on rebar_reconciler.__path__, so an engine-first seed (path==[engine_dir]) resolved the name to the engine module -> 'not a package'. Fix: order shadow dir BEFORE engine dir unconditionally + evict stale non-package classify module. Added RED regression test (engine-first seed) tests/unit/test_reconciler_shadow_package_ordering.py. Pushed as Gerrit change 2252 (below 2249 in the stack).","timestamp":1787797812635730001}],"created_at":1787795452139451001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"416066f1-ab0a-4703-a07e-c655cce1b895","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"1d21-887e-a923-470e"}],"description":"During CI for Gerrit change 2249 the macos-latest/py3.13 pytest leg failed with 4 COLLECTION errors (not test failures; 900 passed): ModuleNotFoundError: 'rebar_reconciler.classify' is not a package, collecting tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/classify/{test_frozen_census,test_matrix,test_multipass_stateful,test_properties}.py. ROOT CAUSE (deterministic mechanism, non-deterministic trigger): the engine ships rebar_reconciler/classify.py as a MODULE, while the test tree tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/classify/ is a PACKAGE sharing the top-level name. _engine_module (src/rebar/_lib_ops.py) seeds sys.modules['rebar_reconciler'] = the ENGINE package; tests/unit/conftest.py::_bridge_reconciler_shadow_package() compensates by putting BOTH shadow-dir and engine-dir on __path__, but under some xdist worker orderings the engine package is seeded WITHOUT the shadow path before a classify test imports, so rebar_reconciler.classify resolves to the engine MODULE and the test package cannot collect. Passes locally (py3.12) and on the ubuntu legs; surfaced only on macos-py3.13. Adding two test files in change 2249 perturbed xdist work-distribution enough to surface this LATENT pre-existing collision; the classify dir is untouched by that change. FIX DIRECTION: harden _bridge_reconciler_shadow_package() to also repair the engine package's __path__ deterministically (append the shadow dir) regardless of seed order, OR rename one side to remove the module-vs-package name collision. Repro aid: run tests/scripts + tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/classify together under xdist -n and vary worker count.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/unit/conftest.py","reason":"Order shadow_dir before engine_dir on rebar_reconciler.__path__ so the classify test-package name resolves to the test package, not the engine classify.py module, regardless of seed order"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_reconciler_shadow_package_ordering.py","reason":"RED regression test: under engine-first seeding the bridge must still resolve rebar_reconciler.classify to a package"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"cf3e3685-4593-47f4-b2e1-ffb8805904d1","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"b900-3cc1-cf6e-470e","ticket_type":"bug","title":"xdist ordering flake: rebar_reconciler.classify module vs test-package shadow collision","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["0f863278-0e80-4b2e-8659-92668ab68341","416066f1-ab0a-4703-a07e-c655cce1b895","cf3e3685-4593-47f4-b2e1-ffb8805904d1","2fc236c7-0b07-4cff-9bb2-27d8b08bf235","85fdb45e-8464-49d5-af49-3687a82712c1","0988214f-8c02-4fe5-b65a-5356b7987b10"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787797812635730002,"uuid":"5ae693fc-351c-42a7-a4ac-8d3f4b67d90c"}